Description: skip the model-download reminder when there is no settings program
 The reminder's "下載模型" button opens the settings program's models page.
 The Debian packages do not ship 0c-settings yet, so the button would only
 fail.  Treat a missing settings program like a disabled download for the
 reminder only: "0c-update models download" keeps working, and reminders
 resume once a settings program is installed.
Author: Kevin Watt <k@funmula.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-27

